WEBVTT

00:07:28.861 --> 00:07:30.137
And within minutes,

00:07:30.161 --> 00:07:32.518
we were sitting in a nearby café
having coffee,

00:07:32.542 --> 00:07:36.314
and there was a queue of people
waiting to do this lovely thing.

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:38.868
Well, that's just
the beginning of the show.

00:07:38.892 --> 00:07:41.025
The real show starts
when the police appears.

00:07:41.049 --> 00:07:42.270
(Laughter)

00:07:42.294 --> 00:07:43.428
"What will they do?"

00:07:43.452 --> 00:07:45.344
Arrest us? We were nowhere to be seen.

00:07:45.368 --> 00:07:48.822
We were like three blocks away,
observing it from our espresso bar.

00:07:49.207 --> 00:07:51.131
Arrest the shoppers, with kids?

00:07:51.155 --> 00:07:52.361
Doesn't make sense.

00:07:52.385 --> 00:07:55.052
Of course, you could bet,
they did the most stupid thing.

00:07:55.076 --> 00:07:56.348
They arrested the barrel.

00:07:56.648 --> 00:07:59.566
And now, the picture
of the smashed face on the barrel,

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:01.900
with the policemen
dragging it to the police car,